ywhere.\nThe app works fully offline and contains no ads or in-app purchases, keeping your training simple and distraction-free.\n\nDesigned for Golf-Specific Movement:\nEvery routine in Better Golf Through Yoga is built around the movements used in the golf swing. The app guides you through poses that support rotation, posture, balance, and strength while minimizing stress on joints. Regular use helps create a smoother, more consistent golf swing and better endurance over a full round of golf.\n\nGuided Programs With Clear Progression:\nStart with a pre-round warm-up made up of 13 guided poses to prepare your muscles before you play. Each pose includes visual guidance, alignment cues, simple instructions, and a clear explanation of how it supports golf performance.\nAs your fitness improves, you progress to the beginner program. This 34-pose routine builds strength, stamina, and flexibility to improve consistency and focus. The advanced program includes a set of 34 poses designed for experienced golfers who want to maintain mobility, energy, and concentration during long or demanding rounds.\n\nTargeted Training for Golf Performance:\nThe app lets you focus on the muscle groups that matter most in golf. Use targeted routines to strengthen wrists and forearms for better ball striking, support shoulders and rotator cuffs, improve spinal posture, develop hips and leg muscles for stability and power, and build core strength for controlled rotation and smoother tempo.\n\nHow You Use the App:\nChoose a routine based on your goal or fitness level, follow the on-screen guidance for each pose, and move through the sequence at your own pace. Use the warm-up before a round, train between rounds to build strength and flexibility, or practice regularly to maintain mobility throughout the season. The app is designed for repeated use as part of your ongoing golf fitness routine.\n\nBuilt for Golfers at Every Level:\nWhether you are a weekend golfer, instructor, or competitive player, Better Golf Through Yoga helps ensure your body supports your game instead of limiting it. With regular practice, you can move more freely, play longer without fatigue, and approach each round with greater confidence.\n\nTrain smarter. Play better. Improve your golf performance with Better Golf Through Yoga.", "bundleId": "com.pramodshankar.GolfYoga1.0", "minimumOsVersion": "18.6", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "sellerUrl": "http://www.shankarapps.com", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "54443008", "formattedPrice": "￦6,600", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackContentRating": "4+", "releaseDate": "2009-08-17T20:41:20Z", "userRatingCount": 0}]}